    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "International Magic is a London-based futurist design/experience studio, founded circa 2016 by Adam Rodgers (ex-Studio Remote, Warp Records work) and Stefan Endress (ex-Future Corp; D&AD graphite pencil, Webby Innovators Award). Core team approx 8 people, 2-10 range confirmed by LinkedIn. Work spans web design, creative technology (interactive installations, Web3/blockchain), identity systems (Maison Margiela global relaunch incl. custom typeface), brand strategy, and live experiences (PinkPantheress, FKA twigs, State of Fashion Biennale). Clients include Nike, Maison Margiela, SSENSE, Selfridges, Somerset House. Also operate a technical product division (Magic as a Service / maas.engineering). Studio-level entity; Autonomy not applicable. Studio sources: intmagic.com, LinkedIn (company), developments.media interview, itsnicethat.com 2017 profile.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-07-13T10:08:31",
      "set_by": "agent"
    },
